  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "dsh-quicklook",
      "text": "QuickLook-style space-key large preview for\n[dsh-better-sidebar](https://www.npmjs.com/package/dsh-better-sidebar): press\n<kbd>Space</kbd> on the active file tab for an instant image / PDF / text\noverlay."
    },
    {
      "section": "How it works",
      "text": "```\nactive file tab (dsh-better-sidebar) ── Space ──▶ large overlay preview\n                                                    ├── images / PDF  → sidebar media route\n                                                    └── text-like     → fs.read\nSpace / Escape ──▶ close overlay"
    },
    {
      "section": "How it works",
      "text": "- **client-only plugin**: the host half is a dormant stub; all behavior lives in\n  the browser half (`src/client/` → `lib/client.js`).\n- <kbd>Space</kbd> outside any input opens the overlay for the sidebar's active\n  file tab; pressing it again (or <kbd>Escape</kbd>) closes it.\n- Zoom scale is remembered across sessions via `localStorage`\n  (`dsh-quicklook:size`).\n- Optional peer contract: without `dsh-better-sidebar` mounted, the plugin\n  contributes nothing (hot-pluggable, either activation order works)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-better-sidebar@0.13.1   # or @0.14+ on DSH rc.8\ndsh plugin --profile desktop add dsh-quicklook@0.1.0"
    },
    {
      "section": "dsh plugin --profile desktop add link:D:/Coding/dsh-quicklook",
      "text": "```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Config",
      "text": "None — the bundle patch simply mounts the client-only plugin:\n\n```yaml\n- insert:\n    - id: quicklook\n      name: 'dsh-quicklook'\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "```sh\npnpm install\npnpm build       # tsc -b && tsdown\npnpm test        # vitest run\npnpm typecheck"
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE)"
    }
  ],
